{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“早晨的亲吻”也越来越狂热。", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啾咕、噗、噗啾噜、嗯呼、咕啾啰、咕啾、噗啾、噗啾……”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2496", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～安洁……”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“主人……啊姆、嗯呼、啾、嗯呼、噗啾……嗯嗯……”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2497", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当我也抱住她之后，亲吻已经升级到唇舌交缠吸吮的程度了。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然眼睛还没有睁开，但是我知道自己已经陶醉得双颊通红。", "text_idx": 510, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，今天又特别地……", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊……”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2498", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸嘿，早安，主人。”", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2499", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“早安……咦？安洁？”", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，今天也是主人喜欢的安洁喔！”", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2500", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀～说出来了～欸嘿、欸嘿嘿、主人主人～”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2501", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃、嗯，我也最喜欢你了，安洁。”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还被主人这样说了！啊啊安洁从一大早就要升天了……”", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2502", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“升天之前可以回答我一个问题吗？”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁喜欢的主人的脸，是想睡觉的时候的表情呢……”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2503", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是不是比平常的时间早很多？”", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2504", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以，比平常多了３成的啾啾喔。”", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2505", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对不起主人！您说的没错！”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2506", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁。”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的。”", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2507", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“再加２成。”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯姆……！？啾、姆啾、嗯呼。”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2508", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼啊、姆啾、啾啾、主人……”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2509", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像真的要升天了……主人的亲吻是１０成的等级……”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2510", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，抱歉抱歉，忍不住就兴起了。”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为这个原因，我们今天比平常更早就出门了。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺带一提，樱乃说完“再睡１０分钟”的声明后就回自己房间了。", "text_idx": 518, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "希望她可以顺利起床。冬天的回笼觉是很可怕的喔，妹妹……", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以……安洁。”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的。”", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2511", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“让您配合安洁真的很对不起。”", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2512", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果让你一个人先出门，那或许的确很抱歉。”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“丢下心爱的主人那种事，安洁罪该万死的。”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2513", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以才让您早起了。啊啊，爱情真是种罪过啊……”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2514", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为你接受我的１０成亲吻了，所以不管多早我都会陪你的。”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过，为什么今天要这么早去学校呢？”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没错，安洁提早叫醒我就是为了让我尽早去学校。", "text_idx": 491, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个、就是啊。”", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2515", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁害羞地红了脸。", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她扭扭捏捏的，双手的指尖互戳了好一会──", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“其实，安洁是想要站在校门口迎接各位同学。”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2516", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──竹扫帚清扫落叶的声音，刷、刷、刷地回响在冬日的天空下。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2517", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔，来了呢……”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欢迎回来～～！”", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2518", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咦？是安洁！？”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ja0061", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真是好久不见的景象了。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁就像以前的每天早上那样，带着竹扫帚笑脸欢迎到校的学生们。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欢迎回来！”", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2519", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "結女生徒３年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀，安洁……我回来了……”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "结女学生3年级", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "jt0001", "char_id": "結女生徒３年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欢迎回来～♪”", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2520", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哇，感觉好久没听到了！！”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "sb0050", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一个又一个到校的学生。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁有朝气地对所有人打招呼，大家虽然惊讶地瞪大眼睛，但都回应了她。", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哇、安洁在呢！”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "结女学生1年级", "alt_speaker_idx": 502, "voice": "jo0001", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，欢迎回来！”", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2521", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，就是要这样才对呢！早上就是想听到这句啊～”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "结女学生1年级", "alt_speaker_idx": 502, "voice": "jo0002", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？是安洁和瓜生啊。”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "da0047", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，早安。”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欢迎回来，呵呵～”", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2522", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈哈，喔！我回来了！”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "da0048", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不分年级和原本的学校，更不分性别。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在旁边看着的我也不禁感到愉快。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、欢迎回来～”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2523", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该是我们才觉得安洁回来了呢！”", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "jc0057", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈、早安！”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“早、早安……瓜生君也在啊……”", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "jc0058", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，安洁温柔的主人陪着安洁喔～讨厌啦～”", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2524", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀啊呀啊、安洁真是个幸福的人！感受到爱对吧～真是受不了呢～”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2525", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，还附赠放闪啊……那就有点尴尬了……”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "jc0059", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过，是怎么了？突然就回来了。”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "jc0060", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸嘿嘿……”", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2526", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁和我对看一眼，然后开心地笑了。", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对于促成我们两人结合的学校的各位。”", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2527", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“现在的安洁想要对各位感谢报恩。”", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2528", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……也就是说。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个行为就是表达了安洁心中与我结合的喜悦。", "text_idx": 511, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸嘿……没有错吧～主人！”", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2529", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能够做这件事也让她很高兴。她看着身旁的我，笑容散发出光彩。", "text_idx": 508, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这让我也跟着高兴。", "text_idx": 514, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这女孩想要这样“报恩”的心情，我非常了解。", "text_idx": 512, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以？明天还会继续吗？”", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ar4107", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "午休时间。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家一起吃着午饭，濑名同学发出疑问。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“考试都结束了，还这么辛苦啊。”", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "sn0384", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为安洁跟纱凪不同，考得还不错，所以才有余裕做这种事吧？”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ar4108", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我什～么都没听到～”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "sn0385", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺带一提，上午已经公布了考试结果。有人进步也有人退步。", "text_idx": 517, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟安洁是小有进步，所以被濑名同学（她依然是不变的年级榜首）夸奖了。", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果你想继续的话，我明天也会陪你的。”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢您。”", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2530", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是连续几天让主人早起安洁觉得很抱歉。”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2531", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%51;“我只要有那个吻就好了。”", "text_idx": 8, "plain": "“我只要有那个吻就好了。”", "plain_idx": 412, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%51;“那样的话反倒是安洁的身体会受不了的……”", "text_idx": 9, "plain": "“那样的话反倒是安洁的身体会受不了的……”", "plain_idx": 452, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2532", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了够了！不要在大家面前亲热！你们这种恋爱脑的家伙！”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "sn0386", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼欸？只是普通的对话啊……”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2533", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咕……这家伙，刚才那种只是小儿科吗……？”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "sn0387", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵呵，你们两个人的水准确实提高了呢。”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "mu0430", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我们的精神耐力不跟着提高的话，很快就会变得没办法一起吃饭了……”", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ar4109", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我已经习惯了，随便你们说都可以。”", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sk1012", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“太可靠了，这下安洁稍微放心了。”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2534", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃、我们也稍微注意一下吧，安洁……”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自从第一次爱爱之后，我们的闪光度真的越来越刺眼了……", "text_idx": 509, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咳咳……虽然早上的校门口迎接原本只打算复活一天。”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原本约好是这样，我继续说下去。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是安洁，你并不想就这样结束吧？”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……您看出来了吗？”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2535", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然了，我是你的主人啊。”", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "应该说早上那只是开端，看得出来安洁“还感谢不够”的心情。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且我也是一样。", "text_idx": 507, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……因为是如此快乐的事。", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“况且大家都很高兴。”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的。”", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2536", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以会继续进行感谢啊。”", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 516, "voice": "ht0375", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那接下来要做什么？”", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 516, "voice": "ht0376", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“照顺序来看，是请慢走？”", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sk1013", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那也不错呢～”", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2537", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是、这个……该怎么说呢，要做的话还是‘决定版！’的感觉比较好呢。”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2538", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "很像喜欢热闹的安洁会说的话。", "text_idx": 483, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“原来如此，既然这样……”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～也不能像以前那样在学校里到处工作呢。”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那样的话事情就变得复杂了。”", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ar4110", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也是……会让好不容易统整好的体制又变回去。”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在的安洁主要是透过我来参与学校的工作，这是不久前我们建立起来的制度。", "text_idx": 494, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而目前没有什么工作呢。应该说，是正在努力适应不派工作给安洁。”", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“组织改善委员会本身，现在也没有工作吗？”", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "mu0431", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为有期末考啊。”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，一边拟定暂定方案，然后寒假中集合几次正式开始运作的感觉吧～”", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 516, "voice": "ht0377", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“姆姆。”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2539", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对喔，再一周这学期就要结束了呢……”", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2540", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到隼太说到寒假，安洁一脸烦恼地开始思考。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要是顾虑得太多都不行动，恐怕会就这样直到休业式了。”", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2541", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“最糟糕的情况呢……”", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但可能性不低。”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sk1014", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今年是２１日休业式对吧？什么嘛，不知不觉中就快到了啊～”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "sn0388", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“圣诞节和过年也很快就来了呢。小熊喵，想要什么礼物呢？”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "mu0432", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜～！”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "pn0121", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“绝对不会把主人给你！”“哥哥是安洁的所以不给。”", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁／樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "go073", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“反正都是瓜生，小樱乃也算吧？”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 516, "voice": "ht0378", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我的话就可以。”", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sk1016", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以吗！？”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ar4111", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那圣诞节就请小樱乃来开特别准备的猫罐头吧。”", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "mu0433", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“尽管来吧。”", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sk1017", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～♪”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "pn0122", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟是特别的节日，大家的话题转移到了圣诞节。", "text_idx": 489, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这是把安洁接回家后的第一个圣诞节。我也不想过得太随便。", "text_idx": 513, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除了想安洁报恩感谢的方法，也要考虑一下那天的准备呢……", "text_idx": 515, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………啊。”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当我将两件事并排在脑海中时，我突然想到一个点子。", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对了，安洁。报恩的事这样做如何？”", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔喔，请告诉安洁……”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2543", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼嗯呼嗯……”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2544", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊啊！主人，就是这个、这个！！”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "ag2545", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
